# ESP32-P4 settings, on top of idf/sdkconfig.defaults (each product target
# can add its own in targets/<target>/idf/sdkconfig.defaults). The console's
# USB options are compile definitions (idf_defines in chip.json), and the flash
# size comes from the target.

# The P4 has no radio. Arduino's base sdkconfig assumes Espressif's dev board,
# where an ESP32-C6 provides WiFi and BLE over SDIO (esp_hosted, slave reset on
# GPIO 54). Baseline does not build esp_hosted, so leave Bluetooth out too;
# Baseline's WiFi and BLE calls report BL_ERR_UNSUPPORTED on this chip.
# CONFIG_BT_ENABLED is not set
